https://x.com/gov_online/status/2106882054990524709/photo/1","ext_alt_text":"政府広報、法務省の新聞突出し広告。上部には「不動産所有の皆さまへ、かんたん・無料の便利でお得な新制度です。スマート変更登記」と記載されている。下部には「申請手続きの手間がゼロ。登録免許税がゼロ。登記漏れがゼロ。将来の売買や相続がスムーズ。」と記載され、その横にトウキツネとパソコンのイラストが描かれており、イラストの右上に「手続きは一度だけ」と記載されている。","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"features":{"large":{"faces":[]},"medium":{"faces":[]},"orig":{"faces":[]},"small":{"faces":[]}},"id_str":"2105914490084831232","indices":[135,158],"media_key":"3_2105914490084831232","media_results":{"result":{"media_key":"3_2105914490084831232"}},"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTm2EjTasAAGoNG.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[{"h":348,"w":622,"x":0,"y":274},{"h":622,"w":622,"x":0,"y":137},{"h":709,"w":622,"x":0,"y":72},{"h":781,"w":391,"x":136,"y":0},{"h":781,"w":622,"x":0,"y":0}],"height":781,"width":622},"sizes":{"large":{"h":781,"resize":"fit","w":622},"medium":{"h":781,"resize":"fit","w":622},"small":{"h":680,"resize":"fit","w":542},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"photo","url":"https://t.co/LQg17A2jMu"}]},"favorite_count":43,"favorited":false,"full_text":"📌不動産をお持ちのかたへ\n\n「スマート変更登記」は、事前に法務局へ生年月日等の検索用情報の申出をしておくことで、引越しなどで住所等が変わった際、変更登記の申請をしなくても、法務局の登記官が職権で変更登記を行う制度です。\n\n詳しくは、法務省ウェブサイトをご確認ください👇 https://t.co/LQg17A2jMu","id_str":"2106882054990524709","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":19,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"461064204"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"moj.go.jp/MINJI/minji05_…","expanded_url":"https://www.moj.go.jp/MINJI/minji05_00688.html","indices":[135,158],"url":"https://t.co/pTtmwFnEae"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDY4ODIwNTQ2MTI5NzU2MTY=","text":"📌不動産をお持ちのかたへ\n\n「スマート変更登記」は、事前に法務局へ生年月日等の検索用情報の申出をしておくことで、引越しなどで住所等が変わった際、変更登記の申請をしなくても、法務局の登記官が職権で変更登記を行う制度です。\n\n詳しくは、法務省ウェブサイトをご確認ください👇\nhttps://t.co/pTtmwFnEae\n\n※10月5日から11日にかけて、新聞各紙にモノクロの広告を順次掲載しています。"}}},"rest_id":"2106882054990524709","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"6628","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2106882054990524709","sortIndex":"2107003692073877451"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":127},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1182494221720145920/1f6PGrY1_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/268732024/1693473523"},"core":{"created_at":"Sat Mar 19 10:39:03 +0000 2011","name":"防衛省・自衛隊","screen_name":"ModJapan_jp"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyNjg3MzIwMjQ=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":"東京都新宿区市谷本村町5-1"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"#防衛省・自衛隊 の公式アカウントです。防衛省の政策や各種活動などの最新情報を発信します。英語による発信▸ @ModJapan_en 災害派遣等の発信▸ @ModJapan_saigai 【Facebook】https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J 【Instagram】 https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"display_url":"facebook.com/mod.japn","expanded_url":"http://facebook.com/mod.japn","indices":[104,127],"url":"https://t.co/MhbTYVAO9J"},{"display_url":"Instagram.com/modjapan","expanded_url":"http://Instagram.com/modjapan","indices":[140,163],"url":"https://t.co/xfOJ2bbbiJ"}]},"url":{"urls":